            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I finally found you!"
            ]
        },
        "134_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're the tiny flower from above?",
                "wait what are you doing here tiny flower?"
            ]
        },
        "142_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard you were coming to find me",
                "but why? you are just a tiny flower against the sun.."
            ]
        },
        "150_0": {
            "lines": [
                "flowers require sunshine to grow healthy."
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess my intuition is as good as ever."
            ]
        },
        "166_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're trying to stop the geyser, right?"
            ]
        },
        "174_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh... right."
            ]
        },
        "182_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If i lose one of my precious flowers because of",
                "some geysers i will turn you into cooked chicken."
            ]
        },
        "190_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You came all the way down here from above ground,",
                "so I hate to tell you this, but..."
            ]
        },
        "198_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The geyser won't stop.",
                "It's too late for that."
            ]
        },
        "206_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<t$Yukari >(oh no. you shouldnt have said that)"
            ]
        },
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The geyser is just a hole to let the excess",
                "part of my ultimate power escape."
            ]
        },
        "222_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've already obtained the ultimate power."
            ]
        },
        "230_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Every time I use it, the geyser gushes forth.",
                "So, I can't stop it."
            ]
        },
        "238_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The ultimate power? oh we'll see if your power",
                "is really that ultimate or it's just the power of a teakettle."
            ]
        },
        "246_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<t$Yukari >(yuuka, you should be able to feel it. ",
                "<l$> Which god did that bird eat up?)"
            ]
        },
        "254_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmmm... The god of extreme heat?",
                "Who knows?"
            ]
        },
        "262_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyway, we came all this way, so if we",
                "just beat her the geyser should stop."
            ]
        },
        "270_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hahaha, I guess it comes to that, after all!"
            ]
        },
        "278_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Once I beat you, I'm going to go above",
                "ground to test out this power of mine."
            ]
        },
        "286_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hohoho, that pathetic place will be",
                "reborn as a new Blazing Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "294_0": {
            "lines": [
                "dont you dare to even lay your eyes",
